REGISTERED AS {ISO10589-ISIS.aoi 
sequenceNumberSkips (23)};

ownLSPPurges ATTRIBUTE
DERIVED FROM nonWrappingCounter;
BEHAVIOUR ownLSPPurges-B BEHAVIOUR
DEFINED AS Number of times the Own LSP Purged 
