this circuit.;;
REGISTERED AS {ISO10589-ISIS.aoi externalDomain 
(46)};


l1IntermediateSystemPriority ATTRIBUTE
WITH ATTRIBUTE SYNTAX 
ISO10589-ISIS.IntermediateSystemPriority;
MATCHES FOR Equality, Ordering;
